ISO-10303-21;
/* Gn177: genuinely RATIONAL B_SPLINE_SURFACE_WITH_KNOTS (degree 2x1, 3x2 net) encoding an
   EXACT quarter-circle profile (radius 2.0, weights (1.0, sqrt(2)/2, 1.0)) extruded straight
   along Z; a target consumer accepting only polynomial (non-rational) B-splines cannot use this
   surface as-is and must re-approximate it into non-rational form; distinct from Gn011's
   excess-DEGREE defect and Gn026's continuity-restriction defect (this is the RATIONAL subvariant
   of seq-bspline-restriction, exercising ShapeCustom_BSplineRestriction's Rational-flag branch) */
